(7396875, 1163837, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot. You''ve managed to make the image about the cart (which is the point of the challenge) but still able to add the person, which usually adds a lot of interest to a picture. Her expression is great. The blur on the product shelves is perfect. The composition is just awesome. I am really drawn into the image, and with a great sense of the motion and excitement. You''ve taken a potentially boring subject and really ramped it up. Nice job!</td>', 'This is an awesome shot. You''ve managed to make the image about the cart (which is the point of the challenge) but still able to add the person, which usually adds a lot of interest to a picture. Her expression is great. The blur on the product shelves is perfect. The composition is just awesome. I am really drawn into the image, and with a great sense of the motion and excitement. You''ve taken a potentially boring subject and really ramped it up. Nice job!', '2015-08-12 03:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
