(7397421, 1163805, 180676, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier, coming back to comment...  TRIPE!  And I LOVE it!  I was trying to get a shot of me "caught in the act" of loading a cart into my car, but the store management and security just wouldn''t go for it.  :(<br/> <br/>Love this shot and the story it tells!  It''s my top pick in this challenge to be sure.</td>', 'Voted earlier, coming back to comment...  TRIPE!  And I LOVE it!  I was trying to get a shot of me "caught in the act" of loading a cart into my car, but the store management and security just wouldn''t go for it.  :( Love this shot and the story it tells!  It''s my top pick in this challenge to be sure.', '2015-08-14 12:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
