(7397578, 1163834, 62249, '<td valign="top">I wish this had been cropped to include any two of the three subjects instead of all three (the lone cart to the left, the To Shops sign, or the father and son with the cart). As is, there''s just a bit too much going on in the image.</td>', 'I wish this had been cropped to include any two of the three subjects instead of all three (the lone cart to the left, the To Shops sign, or the father and son with the cart). As is, there''s just a bit too much going on in the image.', '2015-08-15 16:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
