(7397603, 1163485, 29011, '<td valign="top">Poor teddy. Lost and/or forgotten. The two could go on an adventure. A story in one shot. Open to many possibilities. One of my favorites from the challenge. For my story the cart needed to look a bit more rusty, but that''s a nitpick. (non voter)</td>', 'Poor teddy. Lost and/or forgotten. The two could go on an adventure. A story in one shot. Open to many possibilities. One of my favorites from the challenge. For my story the cart needed to look a bit more rusty, but that''s a nitpick. (non voter)', '2015-08-15 22:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397653, 1163867, 69324, '<td valign="top">Good effort.</td>', 'Good effort.', '2015-08-16 16:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397674, 1163805, 102315, '<td valign="top">Love the creativity</td>', 'Love the creativity', '2015-08-16 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397676, 1163869, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. I think the paint can takes away from the image though. I found myself staring at it trying to figure out what it was when I should be staring at the adorable model and the shopping cart. <br/> <br/>I can only guess that you hung the cart and it was too high for her so you decided on using the can to elevate her instead of lowering the cart? Just a guess. My vote will not be based on the guess but I very curious if I am correct or not. <br/> <br/>I''m giving a 7. 8 without the can for sure.</td>', 'Very cool idea. I think the paint can takes away from the image though. I found myself staring at it trying to figure out what it was when I should be staring at the adorable model and the shopping cart.  I can only guess that you hung the cart and it was too high for her so you decided on using the can to elevate her instead of lowering the cart? Just a guess. My vote will not be based on the guess but I very curious if I am correct or not.  I''m giving a 7. 8 without the can for sure.', '2015-08-16 17:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
