(7398434, 1163869, 6519, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I agree with the DQ.<br/> <br/>The bucket is odd enough and I kept looking at it, wondering about its significance.<br/>Had you not cloned away the strobe light, I would have spent even more time looking at that part of the image.<br/> <br/>You really think you would get the same description/feel/impression from a photo that appears to have a small child magically juggling a cart, vs seeing that it WAS (of course) strung up?<br/> <br/>Sorry, but that is too much "pushing" in my books, too.<br/> <br/>However, it is a super cute shot for the family album!</td>', 'Sorry, but I agree with the DQ. The bucket is odd enough and I kept looking at it, wondering about its significance.Had you not cloned away the strobe light, I would have spent even more time looking at that part of the image. You really think you would get the same description/feel/impression from a photo that appears to have a small child magically juggling a cart, vs seeing that it WAS (of course) strung up? Sorry, but that is too much "pushing" in my books, too. However, it is a super cute shot for the family album!', '2015-08-19 02:45:28.000000', NULL, 0),
