(7398436, 1163700, 51001, '<td valign="top">Nice concept &amp; good technical execution and should have done MUCH better than it did.  Keep at it!</td>', 'Nice concept & good technical execution and should have done MUCH better than it did.  Keep at it!', '2015-08-19 02:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
