(7398444, 1163373, 75618, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in the challenge but this was a stand out. Opulent, in her own way, which is complemented by the golden arches. Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'I didn''t vote in the challenge but this was a stand out. Opulent, in her own way, which is complemented by the golden arches. Congrats on top 10!', '2015-08-19 03:50:11.000000', NULL, 0),
