(7398516, 1163805, 39427, '<td valign="top">This is Awesome.  Way to make lemons out of lemonade, David!  Creative and finely executed image.</td>', 'This is Awesome.  Way to make lemons out of lemonade, David!  Creative and finely executed image.', '2015-08-19 11:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7398524, 1163869, 16912, '<td valign="top">Yup, this was a bummer dq Jeff! However, I guess since many voters obviously thought your daughter was strong enough to hold the trolley up then yes, you tricked them. ok, so a wire may have better suited the challenge but surely the same voters would be tricked again?<br/> <br/>There was an entry not so long ago where an entire ship was poorly (imho) removed from a shot but remember it was ok as when they removed it the sea/sky was replaced and the ship definitely would have distracted my view of the image.<br/> <br/>Still it''s a great shot Jeff :)</td>', 'Yup, this was a bummer dq Jeff! However, I guess since many voters obviously thought your daughter was strong enough to hold the trolley up then yes, you tricked them. ok, so a wire may have better suited the challenge but surely the same voters would be tricked again? There was an entry not so long ago where an entire ship was poorly (imho) removed from a shot but remember it was ok as when they removed it the sea/sky was replaced and the ship definitely would have distracted my view of the image. Still it''s a great shot Jeff :)', '2015-08-19 12:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7398537, 1163373, 163081, '<td valign="top">Oh, why didn''t you put the outtake?????!!?!?!?<br/>I''m sure it would have had much higher points.<br/></td>', 'Oh, why didn''t you put the outtake?????!!?!?!?I''m sure it would have had much higher points.', '2015-08-19 13:43:46.000000', NULL, 0),
