(7398949, 1163719, 60495, '<td valign="top">I love the story here, when I look at the image I see a guy in a hurry, very determined to get to where ever he is headed. possibly taking food to his family, possibly lives alone, either way he has a goal for his journey. Nicely seen and photographed.</td>', 'I love the story here, when I look at the image I see a guy in a hurry, very determined to get to where ever he is headed. possibly taking food to his family, possibly lives alone, either way he has a goal for his journey. Nicely seen and photographed.', '2015-08-21 08:45:36.000000', NULL, 0),
