(7399367, 1163711, 98565, '<td valign="top">Erst jetzt bemerke ich, dass da Lidl draufsteht...ich finds immer wieder einen bemitleidenswerten Anblick, wie sie da so aneinandergekettet rumstehen... ich finde das ist eine gute Komposition mit diesem schmalen Schärfebereich</td>', 'Erst jetzt bemerke ich, dass da Lidl draufsteht...ich finds immer wieder einen bemitleidenswerten Anblick, wie sie da so aneinandergekettet rumstehen... ich finde das ist eine gute Komposition mit diesem schmalen Schärfebereich', '2015-08-23 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7399424, 1163805, 86447, '<td valign="top">hahahaha!    So fun!<br/> <br/>LOL @ your notes.  :D<br/> <br/>I used to always take my own groceries to my car until...<br/> <br/>One of the employees with whom I had a friendship kindly said to me, "You know that when you take your own groceries, that you''re making our job less secure?  We need people to want us to take their groceries to their car for them.  Please let me take yours."<br/> <br/>I''ve never taken my own groceries again. :D<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your RIBBON!<br/></td>', 'hahahaha!    So fun! LOL @ your notes.  :D I used to always take my own groceries to my car until... One of the employees with whom I had a friendship kindly said to me, "You know that when you take your own groceries, that you''re making our job less secure?  We need people to want us to take their groceries to their car for them.  Please let me take yours." I''ve never taken my own groceries again. :D Congratulations on your RIBBON!', '2015-08-23 22:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
