(7400173, 1163700, 25024, '<td valign="top">*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club*<br/> <br/>A great image that fits the challenge very well.<br/> <br/>I love this! This works really well, the silhouettes are very effective with the trolley forming the centre point and the binding bridge that both binds and separates you both at the same time. It makes the trolley an integral and strong part of the whole and as such completely meets the challenge brief with impact.<br/> <br/>I like your low viewpoint it enables you to isolate the scene very effectively from any potentially distracting background. The background you do have is a very appealing sunset with a lovely blue sky that darkens around the upper part where you are both joined in a passionate kiss. The whole thing is very appealing and effective, well done. Your certainly getting your money''s worth out of your new lens!<br/> <br/>There are some good images on the front page of this challenge, its a real shame yours was not there too, it certainly deserved to be, better luck next time, Sid</td>', '*Hello from Sid and the Critique Club* A great image that fits the challenge very well. I love this! This works really well, the silhouettes are very effective with the trolley forming the centre point and the binding bridge that both binds and separates you both at the same time. It makes the trolley an integral and strong part of the whole and as such completely meets the challenge brief with impact. I like your low viewpoint it enables you to isolate the scene very effectively from any potentially distracting background. The background you do have is a very appealing sunset with a lovely blue sky that darkens around the upper part where you are both joined in a passionate kiss. The whole thing is very appealing and effective, well done. Your certainly getting your money''s worth out of your new lens! There are some good images on the front page of this challenge, its a real shame yours was not there too, it certainly deserved to be, better luck next time, Sid', '2015-08-26 16:07:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7400759, 1163805, 29011, '<td valign="top">Such a fun capture. Just happening to be browsing through and there it is, just as fresh as the first time I saw it. Thanks for the good laughs m8.</td>', 'Such a fun capture. Just happening to be browsing through and there it is, just as fresh as the first time I saw it. Thanks for the good laughs m8.', '2015-08-29 00:35:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7401221, 1163492, 103142, '<td valign="top">I was on the road for 3 weeks, so I didn''t get to play as much as I wanted. I only had a phone on which to view images and one night at a gas station to upload my cart. So I''m really late commenting.<br/> <br/>What a great shot!! I was so curious to see what this would look like on a large screen. It didn''t suffer in translation. Awesome on a phone, and awesome on the screen! Congrats on the blue. And you guys were a scary team to go against. What talent!</td>', 'I was on the road for 3 weeks, so I didn''t get to play as much as I wanted. I only had a phone on which to view images and one night at a gas station to upload my cart. So I''m really late commenting. What a great shot!! I was so curious to see what this would look like on a large screen. It didn''t suffer in translation. Awesome on a phone, and awesome on the screen! Congrats on the blue. And you guys were a scary team to go against. What talent!', '2015-08-31 11:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7404115, 1163830, 113591, '<td valign="top">Tis is seriously good for a pinhole. <br/> <br/>Will you ever be able to replicate the feel with fancy equipment?</td>', 'Tis is seriously good for a pinhole.  Will you ever be able to replicate the feel with fancy equipment?', '2015-09-11 09:46:55.000000', NULL, 0);
